1
00:00:06,765 --> 00:00:10,265
An important school announcement has been shared. Then the pickup time changes.

2
00:00:10,526 --> 00:00:15,026
An illustration: change the time, the voice is prepared again, the link stays the same.

3
00:00:16,153 --> 00:00:18,653
No account is needed to try it.

4
00:00:22,729 --> 00:00:26,729
A sample announcement. Replace every word if you like. The voice is prepared automatically by AssemblyAI.

5
00:00:30,231 --> 00:00:32,031
Real speech is ready. I listen to the whole preview before anything is public.

6
00:00:47,076 --> 00:00:48,876
Nothing is public until I publish it.

7
00:00:55,087 --> 00:00:58,087
Published. This link is what parents receive.

8
00:00:59,816 --> 00:01:03,316
The listener page: no account, no autoplay, the full text beside the audio.

9
00:01:10,401 --> 00:01:12,901
Now the pickup time changes: 3 PM becomes 4 PM.

10
00:01:13,038 --> 00:01:17,538
The old voice is marked out of date. The new one is prepared when I stop typing.

11
00:01:23,037 --> 00:01:24,837
The corrected speech is ready. I listen to it before approving.

12
00:01:38,801 --> 00:01:41,301
The old announcement stays live until I approve this one.

13
00:01:47,819 --> 00:01:50,819
Updated. The link has not changed.

14
00:01:52,659 --> 00:01:57,159
The same link now says 4:00 PM, marked as corrected, with the new voice.

15
00:02:02,274 --> 00:02:06,274
The words changed. The voice changed. The link stayed the same.
